    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "First, please don't be alarmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will admit that I did not see Old Pancho's plan coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never expected that my trusted subordinate would do something as horrifying as to plot against me to take this city. How terrifying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, as I said in the beginning, this is no cause for alarm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rather, I must give Pancho my thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, I've been wondering for the past two years what we could do to make the championship more exciting, more eye-opening, and more thrilling to all of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've never found a particularly nice way to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet Pancho's found it. Through his actions, he's putting on an even more exciting championship!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think the championship's over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not at all. At that very moment, our championship has reached its true climax!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this point in time, all teams are revived, and betting has reopened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop the troublemakers that are sowing chaos in the city to the best of your ability. I know you can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And once everything comes to a successful conclusion, you will be adequately rewarded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_197_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you must be the ones. My subordinates told me you helped them foil a plan to assassinate me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, sit with me. As your reward, you may sit here in the front row to enjoy this match with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_197_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... serious?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I'm always serious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pancho knows he wouldn't stand much of a chance if he flipped the table right in front of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why he's holing up in the ship I entrusted to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if my guess is correct, he probably added quite a few features to it in secret. Maybe a cannon or two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if that was all there was to it, it would hardly be a threat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Between the second and third rounds, we invite dignitaries from all factions to board the ship so they may enjoy the competition in person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_197_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I see. The dignitaries. That's the key here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "The city's operations depend on dealing with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, right, right. It isn't a matter of whether I want to solve this problem of his or not, but whether the bigwigs' underlings want me to solve his problem right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk, making such a huge ruckus, only by playing dirty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was probably Ernesto who taught him that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, as you can see, there isn't much I can do, and there isn't much that he can do either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, we might as well make things more interesting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_197_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't that be provoking him...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If he actually dragged the brass hats out to slaughter one by one, he wouldn't be doing much with the city even if I handed him the keys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't get it, Missy. He wants to take over the city and take it to war, so he needs the big shots' backing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, he wouldn't have the money or manpower to actually go to war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if I had to guess, some of the big shots on the ship might already have come to an agreement with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Now I'm taking an interest in you young ladies. From the way you are dressed, I suppose you're not from Bol\u00edvar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, we are from Lungmen, and two of our friends happen to be on the ship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? So you are friends of Ch'en and Lin? They didn't mention you at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We didn't tell them we'd be here on a vacation, so that makes sense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha, I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, let me tell you one more thing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave Ch'en and Lin this mission, but I also promised Lady Fumizuki that they would not come to harm during their stay here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what that means?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It means it's not yet time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know your stuff, young lady of Higashi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if something does happen to them, then I'm afraid the old men on the ship will find themselves lost at sea, thanks to Pancho.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Missy, don't be scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, come. They say that it takes a fight to get to know each other. It just happens there's one unfolding before us. Come, sit down. Let's talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
