    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things don't look good here, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like having you deal with Ernesto while I investigate didn't save us enough time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not happy about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not one bit... but not much I can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This whole affair isn't all that simple. We knew that ahead of time, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't expect things to get so out of hand, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In one of the cabins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I took a stroll around while you had your chat with Ernesto. The atmosphere wasn't all that tense before Pancho put his plans in motion, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But right after his speech, the crew and the sailors started to make their move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "The whole ship is on high alert now, and they are very well-supplied and well-equipped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like you're ready for a seesaw battle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We aren't completely out of options just yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you figure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They locked all the dignitaries in a single room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Common practice among thugs... Hold on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's start with the hostages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you figured it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter how many weapons they have on the ship, how well supplied they are, and how many men they have to support them on land, Lady Candela has control here. The best outcome he can hope for is a draw.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The odds will be against him if it drags out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "These hostages are basically his lifeline.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, that's right. These dignitaries are high officials in the three governments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "As hostages, they really help keep things in check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't take very long. All he needs is a brief moment, he just needs Lady Candela to hesitate for a second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then he'll get to do so much more. He'll have so many more bargaining chips.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there's only the two of us here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, I really am not into the idea of playing hero of justice with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll get their attention and leave the hostages to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That could work. There should be a lifeboat on the ship, or we could make them jump into the sea and swim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happens after that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll run after everyone's rescued?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to stay on the ship and play the hero, feel free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that's how it'll go, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, should we begin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's do it. Right, don't hang up. Stay in touch with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
