        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hermano, are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Ch'en woman knocked you out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right... Now I remember...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the situation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are proceeding according to plan. A few of the bigwigs have already agreed to help Papa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, where's Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems she's been causing a ruckus all over the ship after knocking you out. Papa ordered everyone to find and capture her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Causing a ruckus... No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rafaela, check the hostage holding area right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en might be creating an opening for Lin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in trouble if they manage to save the hostages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But what about you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. Now go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
